SCP FOUNDATION CONTENT

  The game has some: the SCP Foundation's Site-91 North on the Nunatak Reach
  map, its signs and the three-arrows mark on them, the Class-D transfer
  mission and the Last Flight Out mission (src/features/scp-site.js,
  src/game/extra/scp.js, src/features/scp-escape.js, src/game/extra/scp-escape.js,
  and the map and outfit entries that go with them — each is marked with this credit:
  "SCP Foundation content by the SCP Wiki community, CC BY-SA 3.0,
  scpwiki.com"). Anything in the game that is based on the SCP Foundation —
  the names, the articles, the logo, anything taken or adapted from the SCP
  Wiki (scpwiki.com) — is the work of the SCP Wiki community and is licensed
  under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 (CC BY-SA 3.0), not under
  this licence. If you copy or change that part
  of the game, the CC BY-SA 3.0 terms apply to it: credit the SCP Wiki and its
  authors, and share your version of that content under the same licence.
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

DOWNLOADED MODELS AND FONTS

  The aircraft, tree, scenery and SCP models fetched from Sketchfab are by
  their authors under CC BY 4.0, credited in the game's Credits screen and in
  assets/models/LICENSES.md; the airline lettering fonts are under the SIL
  Open Font Licence (assets/fonts/FONTS.md). Those stay under their own
  licences.

